-2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that by replacing ${a}_{31}$ and ${a}_{42}$ with $0$, we get a matrix in row echelon form:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\,⟶\\,[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe other options will not give us a matrix in row echelon form." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73149/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe0050b2-b5bc-54a6-aeaf-94cd5d7e5dfb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73149"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" :answer/id #uuid "4600677b-34c1-5f95-a708-a7204e687a4b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection/9ed3305a02906a861616af6ff886306c4a2a74885d99f506419451b33c7c9d2d" :answer/id #uuid "d7190931-4c0e-590a-a2ba-f077e43acacc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" :answer/id #uuid "22baa6e7-6d0e-57f1-85a4-1e707b59f29b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" :answer/id #uuid "ff8e2536-bf19-5b70-9fbe-a56664072aa1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection/f073cec77042b855fcc95ae59e5c07a0d566930857e27de8effde7dcda1f144f" :answer/id #uuid "55eeaa67-d862-5f32-9f01-bbce2dbf41ef" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A,$ $B,$ and $C$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "430f4241-c4bb-5bd2-8be8-c059ab8ee3a5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129217/selection/9ed3305a02906a861616af6ff886306c4a2a74885d99f506419451b33c7c9d2d" :answer-field/choices ["q-129217/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" "q-129217/selection/9ed3305a02906a861616af6ff886306c4a2a74885d99f506419451b33c7c9d2d" "q-129217/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" "q-129217/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" "q-129217/selection/f073cec77042b855fcc95ae59e5c07a0d566930857e27de8effde7dcda1f144f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129217" :question/id #uuid "8f982d65-21d3-5ca8-afbe-be436c69b22a" :question/math-academy-id "q-129217" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a matrix is in row echelon form if it satisfies the following conditions:\n\n- All the zero rows (rows with only zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry ${a}_{45}\\ne 0$ (condition II is violated). \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $B$ and $C$ are in row echelon form." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129217/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2d390841-351e-54f5-ad19-90b6ebae5799"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129217"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" :answer/id #uuid "1381dee6-8e88-5e89-ada4-4145e933a531" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" :answer/id #uuid "e7039c8f-65e4-58d6-b3ea-5c6981c1f2e3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" :answer/id #uuid "774ff914-9194-5931-b811-dbae33dc2071" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" :answer/id #uuid "21c4b37e-1d26-5481-a336-479731ea1aa2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection/e432f1020975ada4c83798ae75bfd6c0ae4dfe63215763f08b8be8ccabf8a5d3" :answer/id #uuid "8f8cc0ef-7151-50e6-ad16-8cddd843d2f4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "008b7ec1-052a-5115-8999-34407150f2d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129233/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" :answer-field/choices ["q-129233/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" "q-129233/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" "q-129233/selection/e956c3af673c94782038951d8de50bf89c9a53bf4daf2ca6725a4bea4229074c" "q-129233/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" "q-129233/selection/e432f1020975ada4c83798ae75bfd6c0ae4dfe63215763f08b8be8ccabf8a5d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129233" :question/id #uuid "33776114-3c7b-5ab2-b309-52b0995d6a3c" :question/math-academy-id "q-129233" :question/problem "Which of the following augmented matrices are **not** in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 9 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 6\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that an augmented matrix is in row echelon form if its coefficient matrix satisfies the following conditions:\n\n- All the zero rows (rows with only zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the first row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 9 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $A$ is **not** in row echelon form." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129233/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f5d1d859-0b86-5507-a7bf-3d805a85adf3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129233"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection/58c2d695f50ce0654c9cd915739611e9a3de3e831d6b4edaa235c863c4299052" :answer/id #uuid "e5a317c3-0343-5d97-965e-c80f19229a9b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${a}_{31}$ and ${a}_{32}$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection/ec19d5301bf5139e038b8fbe4b6a2a333d3dacf2073cd23b0bcee22cf3df6e07" :answer/id #uuid "9a59d31e-4329-5d6b-b35f-be68c669e961" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${a}_{31}$, ${a}_{43}$ and ${a}_{44}$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection/6e05a132a8a32f3b49d9e3beb44adde32dc47de3d7f98ada923c414fa018af4f" :answer/id #uuid "d2a961a1-6b50-52e0-a7c5-3756fd204415" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${a}_{31}$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection/7e2d75a2d5732377bca7c2330057c1b825a4314db97f1ae7d9723e2462279561" :answer/id #uuid "86440c5f-9c94-50a7-8a0a-f4828ab713e3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${a}_{31}$, ${a}_{32}$ and ${a}_{33}$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection/79c14f0cf20857a4c8907c9ca1cee06cbb8d06543cd6f1e9c470e23d36e6089a" :answer/id #uuid "5b351496-6413-552f-ae77-dbee4c0615b4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${a}_{31}$, ${a}_{32}$ and ${a}_{43}$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129424/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ff9665d-e78f-5c53-b571-7c3c14aad1c1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129424/selection/79c14f0cf20857a4c8907c9ca1cee06cbb8d06543